# §43's Agents & Workspaces guide. Registered HERE and not in services/qmldir,
# even though the files live under services/agents/: a singleton declared in two
# modules is instantiated twice, one per module, and the two copies would
# disagree about whether the first-run card is dismissed. src/ is the module
# every consumer already imports — AgentCenter through `import "../../"`,
# IpcManager through `import "../"`.
singleton AgentHelp 1.0 services/agents/AgentHelp.qml
singleton AgentHelpContent 1.0 services/agents/AgentHelpContent.qml
# P1-023's push-to-talk route. Registered HERE and deliberately NOT also in
# services/qmldir, for the reason spelled out above AgentHelp — a singleton
# declared in two modules is instantiated twice, one per module. Two of these
# would each hold their own recorder and their own idea of whether the
# microphone is currently open, and the indicator would be bound to whichever
# copy the topbar happened to resolve. src/ is the module its two consumers
# already import: IpcManager through `import "../"` and the topbar indicator
# through `import "../.."`.
singleton PushToTalkService 1.0 services/PushToTalkService.qml
